1
00:00:00,458 --> 00:00:02,377
Why all of a sudden?

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,421
No, never mind.

3
00:00:04,421 --> 00:00:06,506
I was just joking.

4
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:08,133
I'll go get the medicine.

5
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:19,310
I'm losing it.

6
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,771
Should I tell her or not?

7
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:24,065
Why am I acting like this?

8
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:26,294
Why am I suddenly thinking

9
00:00:26,295 --> 00:00:27,777
about what happened long ago?

10
00:00:32,407 --> 00:00:34,034
Get it together.

11
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:36,494
But why the sudden joke?

12
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:39,914
Did I give her too much work?

13
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:43,251
It's lunchtime, let's go eat.

14
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:44,485
I already had lunch

15
00:00:44,486 --> 00:00:45,670
with the team leader.

16
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,547
What, just the two of you?

17
00:00:47,964 --> 00:00:49,674
It just happened that way.

18
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,479
I'm getting jealous.

19
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,219
You said you'd eat with me.

20
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:54,763
That's just how it turned out.

21
00:00:54,763 --> 00:00:55,472
Sorry.

22
00:00:55,472 --> 00:00:56,515
What's going on

23
00:00:56,516 --> 00:00:58,058
between the two of you?

24
00:00:58,725 --> 00:01:00,435
There's nothing going on.

25
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:02,186
We're just a boss and junior

26
00:01:02,187 --> 00:01:03,480
at work, that's all.

27
00:01:06,191 --> 00:01:07,191
Hello.
